	AM_PO_SUBDIRS
	Swap AM_PO_SUBDIRS and ZW_GNU_GETTEXT_SISTER_DIR lines in
	*/configure.ac.  ZW_GNU_GETTEXT_SISTER_DIR indirectly invokes
