	|                                                                             |
	|                                                                             |
	|                                                                             |
	|                                                                             |
	|                                                                             |
	|                                                                             |
	+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
	...

	The source window title shouldn't be showing tui-layout.c.  It's the source
