	'--enable-inprocess-agent=yes'.

	Approved-By: Simon Marchi <simon.marchi@efficios.com>

2025-01-29  Tankut Baris Aktemur  <tankut.baris.aktemur@intel.com>

	gdbserver: use inheritance to define tracepoint contexts
