	AC_REQUIRE([AC_TYPE_UINTMAX_T]) is not garded or inside a function, so it
	will also automatically be run for the configure.ac files using
	AC_CONFIG_MACRO_DIRS([../config]) instead of m4_include([../config/stdint.m4]).

