	However, it's clear from gdb.log on Linux:

	{"type": "event", "event": "module", "body": {"reason": "new", "module": {"id": "system-supplied DSO at 0x7ffff7fc4000", "name": "system-supplied DSO at 0x7ffff7fc4000"}}, "seq": 21}

