	mips64el-openbsd  -FAIL: mips jalx
	mips64el-openbsd  -FAIL: ST Microelectronics Loongson-2F workarounds of Jump Instruction issue

	Co-Authored-By: Maciej W. Rozycki <macro@orcam.me.uk>

