	[gdb/testsuite] Use shlib gdb_compile option in gdb.base/skip-solib.exp
	In test-case gdb.base/skip-solib.exp the linking against a shared library is
	done manually:
	...
	if {[gdb_compile "${binfile_main}.o" "${binfile_main}" executable \
