	/vol/src/gnu/gdb/hg/master/dist/gdb/procfs.c:2814:26: note: length computed here
	 2814 |             len = strlen (p);
	      |                   ~~~~~~~^~~

	  It seems that this is another case of GCC PR middle-end/88059, which
