	gdb: ensure extension_language_python is always defined
	In this commit:

	  commit c6a6aad52d9e839d6a84ac31cabe2b7e1a2a31a0
	  Date:   Mon Oct 25 17:25:45 2021 +0100

	      gdb/python: make some global variables static

