	...
	PASS: gdb.mi/mi-nsmoribund.exp: print done = 1
	Expecting: ^(.*[^M
	]+)?([^
	]*^M
	\*running,thread-id="[0-9]+"^M
	\*running,thread-id="[0-9]+"^M
	\*running,thread-id="[0-9]+"^M
