	gdb compile failed, warning: Could not find DWO CU \
	  fission-relative-dwo.dwo(0x1234) referenced by CU at offset 0xc7 \
	  [in module outputs/gdb.dwarf2/fission-relative-dwo/.tmp/fission-relative-dwo]
