		when calculating string table file location.

2021-07-30  Alan Modra  <amodra@gmail.com>

	IMAGE_SCN_LNK_NRELOC_OVFL
	From microsoft docs: It is an error if IMAGE_SCN_LNK_NRELOC_OVFL is
